course: dictionary
lesson: 8768
title: Words about water and waste
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Sewage is a word you may meet in science or geography. Look at the words around it for clues. «Tap water is cleaned at a water treatment works and used water is cleaned again at a sewage works.» Tap water and used water are both cleaned, so a sewage works must be a place that cleans used water.
explain: «When you pull the plug in the bath, the water gurgles away down the drain, under the street, all the way to a sewage works where bacteria help clean it.» Water from baths, sinks and toilets travels a long way before it is cleaned. Sewage must be the dirty water that goes down our drains.
explain: «Never play or swim in floodwater, because it contains sewage, chemicals and hidden dangers.» The warning and the word hidden tell you sewage is dangerous. Check your meaning by swapping it in: "dirty water and waste from drains" fits the sentence, so it makes sense.
fact: Sewage is the dirty water and waste from toilets, sinks and drains.
fact: Sewage flows through pipes called sewers.
fact: At a sewage treatment plant, sewage is cleaned before the water goes back into rivers or the sea.
fact: Clean sewage systems helped stop diseases like cholera.
fact: Sewage is uncountable, so we say "some sewage", not "a sewage".
exercise: «Never play or swim in floodwater, because it contains sewage, chemicals and hidden dangers.» What is sewage? | Rain that falls on roofs | Clean water from the tap | *Dirty water and waste from toilets, sinks and drains | Fresh air blowing off the sea
exercise: «At a sewage works, waste water is screened, settled in tanks and cleaned by helpful bacteria.» Find and copy one word from this sentence that names tiny living things that help clean sewage. | screened | *bacteria | works | tanks
exercise: The lesson says to wash your hands after a flood. Why should you do this? | Floodwater is always clean and warm | Hands get cold in water | *Floodwater may carry sewage, which can make you ill | Floodwater makes your hands go wrinkly
test: «Tap water is cleaned at a water treatment works and used water is cleaned again at a what?» Which words complete the sentence? | *A sewage works | A sandy beach | A river | A swimming pool
test: Which phrase is correct, because sewage is uncountable? | a sewage | three sewages | many sewage | *some sewage
exam: What must you never do in floodwater, because it contains sewage? | *Play or swim in it | Take a photograph of it | Walk past it on the path | Look at it from the bank
